  "epilogue": "## Licensing\n\n- Repository license is `MPL-2.0`.\n- Code imported from third parties must be checked for MPL-2.0 compatibility before merging.\n- Squalor LLC brand marks (RF badge, seal, SSS) are not licensed for this app; see `~/code/squalor-xyz/branding/LICENSE`.",
  "goals": "- Ship a local-first Android habit/measurement tracker to F-Droid, Google Play and GitHub releases.\n- Entries are the source of truth; streaks, totals and trends are derived and editable through history.\n- One-tap daily logging with a clear \"done today\" state.\n- Reliable local reminders without exact-alarm permission.\n- Portable data: versioned JSON backup (import replaces state) and flat CSV export.\n- FLOSS-clean (MPL-2.0): no proprietary dependencies, analytics, ads or accounts.",
